# play.scen -- at the AI table with two bots: a burst for tools/rowcheck.py
# while the game runs, the help (H) and back, then L leaves for the list.
wait 60
snap title
wait 300
press down
press down
wait 10
press fire
wait 600
burst live 60
key H
wait 40
snap help
key SPACE
wait 90
snap back
key L
wait 300
snap left
